sentence=Arduino library for DWIN DGUS/T5L HMI displays with touch callbacks, text/color, and multi-curve plotting.
paragraph=Implements the native DWIN serial protocol (0x80-0x83) with optional CRC16-CCITT. Supports register and VP read/write, non-blocking touch callbacks, text and RGB565 color helpers, single and multi-channel rolling-window curves with scaling, backlight control, RTC access, and buzzer loudness. Works with any Arduino board via HardwareSerial or SoftwareSerial.
